{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 164717, "game_id": 1164, "entry_id": 110880, "uid": 82806, "type": 4, "title": "星图困难3攻略", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1660200241, "updated_at": 1660200241, "updated_uid": 0, "comment_at": 1676261626, "last_at": 1676261626, "comment_count": 7, "status": 1, "summary": "作者：抱豹233https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv17068037出处：bilibili历时3个月，终于结束了星云3坐牢之旅。首先是打通关的截图留念，后面会写一下打通星云", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/894439.jpg,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/768676.png,//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/523792.png", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 2, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 6734, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 1, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 164717, "content": "<div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:20px;\">作者：抱豹233 https://www.bilibili.com/read/cv17068037 出处：bilibili</span><br></span></span></span></div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><div><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></span></div>历时3个月，终于结束了星云3坐牢之旅。<br style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span><br style=\"\">首先是打通关的截图留念，后面会写一下打通星云道中的队伍以及打各关boss的阵容。</span><br style=\"\"></span><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"480\" data-height=\"800\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/894439.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/894439.jpg\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 416px;\"></div><br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br style=\"\">接下来是道中所用到的阵容，其实在刚开星云3的时候，用了很多种阵容去打，但是最近日服出了新角色-5星忍者（我也不知道她应该叫啥），非常适合打道中，我也是用了她之后<span style=\"font-size: 20px;\"></span>，不到一天的时间就打完了星云3的7、8两层，所以，本帖中只介绍两套打道中的阵容，足以应付星云全部的道中关卡。<span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">补充一句，我这里的阵容，都是手操用，不是自动！不是自动！不是自动！</span><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">①常规道中阵容<br style=\"\"></span><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"451\" data-height=\"246\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/289975.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/289975.jpg\"></div><br style=\"\">阵容如图，用到的角色是<a href=\"https://dcj.gamekee.com/81431.html\" target=\"_blank\">光琴</a>、艳后、<a href=\"https://dcj.gamekee.com/81032.html\" target=\"_blank\">兔女郎</a>、<a href=\"https://dcj.gamekee.com/158994.html\" target=\"_blank\">忍者</a>、花奶，队长给的是光琴，但是为了贪点伤害，给艳后队长也没有问题。本阵容适用于道中大部分关卡，除了打带有巨奶的队伍，带巨奶的队伍参加阵容②。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">本套阵容需要注意以下几点：<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">1）先打忍者的ss，上催眠后，再打出带有集中buff的艳后ss或艳后的ds。因为忍者没有加速，所以充能很慢，大部分时间艳后的条是先与忍者充满的，如果艳后有光琴的加速buff，那可以先打下n，如果没有加速，那可以等忍者充满打ss后再打出ss；中了催眠的敌人防御降为0，就连我的肉装艳后，打到催眠角色上都有高额伤害（打催眠的暗属性角色，5w左右伤害，打催眠的非暗属性角色，2.8w左右伤害）；<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">2）ds顺序，如果对方有被催眠角色，可以用艳后ds，如果没有，则视情况使用兔女郎盾ds或忍者ds，打ft前使用光琴ds。ds的释放一定不要贪伤害，有角色血线不足时，赶紧使用兔女郎或花奶续命；<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">3）艳后建议带肉装，否则很容易死，一定要把血量太高，我的装备属性如下图。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"567\" data-height=\"561\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/768676.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/768676.png\"></div><br style=\"\">②应对巨奶敌人的道中阵容<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"450\" data-height=\"251\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/133913.jpg\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/133913.jpg\"></div><br style=\"\">在后面的道中敌人中，有些阵容会有巨奶角色，比如大木奶或者<a href=\"https://dcj.gamekee.com/81208.html\" target=\"_blank\">巧克力奶</a>，他们的奶量十分惊人，甚至有的道中会遇到大木奶+相机的组合，这种阵容光靠催眠打伤害是打不死对面的，所以需要一个<a href=\"https://dcj.gamekee.com/81029.html\" target=\"_blank\">毒奶角色</a>，让对面把自己奶死，相比于蛇罗，我更推荐这个毒奶，他的毒奶持续时间更长，且在上毒奶的同时还能奶一口自己人，拉高我方血线。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"divider-line divider-line4\"></div><br style=\"\">最后，再说一下我的道中boss阵容，我打道中boss同样只用到了两套阵容，分别是针对火属性boss的水属性raid阵容以及针对其他四种属性的木属性raid阵容。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">①针对火boss<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"548\" data-height=\"299\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/995460.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/995460.png\"></div><br style=\"\">相比于传统的水属性raid阵容，把丹丹换成了巧克力奶防止翻车，其实也可以带海王星，在boss要放ds前使用海王星ds，给队伍上生命链接，防止刀暴毙。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\">②针对其他属性boss的阵容<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"486\" data-height=\"313\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/692611.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/692611.png\"></div><br style=\"\">其实这要是很常规的一套raid阵容，主要靠阿尼ft输出，但是如果想要用这套阵容打通全部的boss，对阵容也有一定的要求，因为我打最后一个boss赛特的时候，打的十分极限，还剩最后一秒打死的boss。。我在使用这套阵容打赛特时，打了6个ft，ft单下伤害25w，大家打到这个boss时，如果ft单下伤害不到这个数字，那请放弃这个阵容。<br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img data-width=\"480\" data-height=\"800\" data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/523792.png\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/523792.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 500px;\"></div><br style=\"\"><br style=\"\"><br></span></span></span>", "content_json": "", "content_cdn": "", "is_favorite": 0, "is_like": 0, "is_unlike": 0, "thumb_list": ["//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/894439.jpg", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/768676.png", "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/94306/2022/5/12/523792.png"], "model_list": [], "user": {"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "description": "", "follow_num": 24, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 1, "is_super": false, "status": 1, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 1, "content_at": 114945282, "content_num": 85, "read_num": 465756, "like_num": 318}, "update_user": {"uid": 0, "username": "", "avatar": "", "description": "", "follow_num": 0, "custom_tag": {"tag_name": "", "tag_color": ""}, "role_id": 0, "is_super": false, "status": 0, "is_followed": 0, "subscribe_num": 0, "content_at": 0, "content_num": 0, "read_num": 0, "like_num": 0}, "game": {"id": 1164, "name": "天命之子日服", "icon": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1164/57/2022/0/26/583959.png", "alias": "dcj", "content_count": 1066, "follow_count": 708}, "themes": null, "seo_format": {"title": "", "desc": "", "key": ""}, "video_format": {"cover": "", "video": "", "width": "", "height": "", "duration": 0, "video_compressed": ""}, "contributor": [{"uid": 82806, "username": "大花", "avatar": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/avatar/1/23.png", "last_ip_area": "未知", "last_login_device_num": 2}], "vote_list": null, "ban_image_list": null, "is_strategy": false, "is_strategy_v1": false, "entry_data_bind": null, "entry_data_bind_cd